[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# .NET Core / NuGet
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
